-- הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) מיום 12.1.2011 — הקצאת מסגרת עלות התוספות ותוספת
-- 2011: the public-sector framework agreement between the State and the
-- public employers and the New General Histadrut, for the scales the
-- Histadrut represents (annex א'). Its period and whom it covers (§§2–3);
-- the cost frame of 1.1.2009–30.6.2012 (6.25% in all), allocated from
-- 1.1.2011 (2.25%), 1.1.2012 (to 4.25%) and 1.1.2013 (to 6.25%), with the
-- one-time grant of 2010 (§§4–5); the salary base it is measured on and how
-- (§§6–8); "תוספת 2011", 2.25% from 1.1.2011 (§9); further negotiation, the
-- data the Histadrut may ask for, and the supplement that grows by default
-- where no agreement allocates a step (§10); the day-care supplement (§11);
-- pension provident-fund contributions (§12); the first school day as a day
-- of choice (§13); budgetary pensioners (§14); the structure of employment
-- (§15); havraa pay (§16); disputes, exhaustion of claims, industrial peace,
-- earlier agreements, the follow-up committee and the agreed arbitration
-- institution (§§17–22). Annexed: the scales (א'), the Treasury's circulars
-- on the one-time grant (ב'), the collective agreement amending the
-- pension-transition agreement of 3.3.99 (ג'; that agreement imported:
-- 1999-03-03_framework-agreement_public-sector_pension-transition), and the table that raises
-- the budgetary pensioners' determining salary (ד').
--
-- It covers no teaching employee: the teaching scale is not in annex א'.
-- The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011 gives the secondary teachers "the
-- supplement agreed with the Histadrut" in it at rates of its own
-- (oz-founding-38) and restates its §11 (oz-founding-47). It speaks to no
-- pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root. Its amendment of
-- 11.4.2011 is held by the corpus without its words.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `1999-03-03_framework-agreement_public-sector_pension-transition`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) — הקצאת מסגרת עלות התוספות ותוספת 2011 (12.1.2011)`

DECLARE `2011 framework action` IS ONE OF
    `negotiate an agreement allocating the cost frame`
    `transfer the salary data the Histadrut asks for`
    `examine a request to process salary data favourably`
    `tell the Histadrut the estimated cost of processing the data`
    `tell the employer whether the Histadrut bears that cost`
    `produce and deliver the processed data against payment`
    `pay the 2011 supplement from the January 2011 salary`
    `pay the January 2011 differences with the February 2011 salary`
    `pay the 2011 framework day-care supplement`
    `decide a disagreement over a general day-care arrangement under the framework`
    `raise the pension contributions of 1.1.2011 with the February or March 2011 salary`
    `circulate the bill amending the Pensions Law`
    `support the bill amending the Pensions Law`
    `demand a further rise for the period to 30.6.2012`
    `give another benefit for the pensioners' rise`
    `circulate the bill amending the havraa law`
    `go on discussing the structure of employment`
    `cooperate to improve the service`
    `negotiate further on pay for the period to 30.6.2012`
    `strike or lock out over a matter the 2011 framework agreement settled`
    `decide disputes over the 2011 framework agreement`
    `pay the one-time grant of 2010`
    `apply in writing to the wages commissioner to pay the one-time grant`
    `make the pension contributions of the amended pension-transition agreement`

`why its amendment of 11.4.2011 is not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 11.4.2011, תיקון הסכם 2011: הקורפוס מחזיק את המסמך בלי מילותיו"

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp (15.6.2011, nos. 7008/2011 and 51/2011); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The Centre of Regional Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The Union of Religious Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The National Insurance Institute; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The Employment Service; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The Hebrew University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 Bar-Ilan University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 Ben-Gurion University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The University of Haifa, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 Tel Aviv University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The Technion, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The Weizmann Institute, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The Hadassah Medical Organisation; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p20 Clalit Health Services; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p21 Israel Post, its director-general left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p22 The fire-service associations of towns; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p23 The Jewish Agency, for itself and the national institutions, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p24 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p25 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p26 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p27 The Histadrut and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p28 The Histadrut's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p29 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p30 A recital: the parties negotiated the cost frame of the wage agreements for 1.1.2009–30.6.2012 and further benefits for that time.
-- akn:preamble/p31 A recital: they set the understandings down in this agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p32 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: the day of signing.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the 2011 framework agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 12 1 2011

§§ `1–3 מבוא, תקופה ותחולה`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.
-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.
-- akn:art_3 The heading of §3.

-- §1 ¶1: the preamble is part of the agreement. ¶2: its headings are for
-- convenience only and do not bear on its reading: the agreement itself
-- answers here what convention precedence.heading answers where a text is
-- silent.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 2011 framework agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_1/p2
`the 2011 framework agreement's headings bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

-- §2: the agreement is for the time to 31.12.2012, the day in (convention
-- dates.end).
@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 2011 framework agreement's period` d IF
    d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012)

-- §3 ¶1: it covers every employee of an employer that signed it whose pay
-- is computed by the collective agreements of a scale the Histadrut
-- represents that annex א' lists ("עובד"), as the agreement and the
-- agreements of §10 set out. Annex א' keeps out of the jurists' and the
-- public defenders' scales those whose pay is linked to a judicial
-- officer's. ¶4: for the avoidance of doubt it does not cover the social
-- workers', the foreign service's, the state attorneys' (one linked to a
-- judicial officer's pay among them), the civil research's and the
-- veterinarians' scales, the parties' claims on them reserved.
@desc An employee, as far as the framework agreement of 12.1.2011 asks.
DECLARE `2011 framework employee` HAS
    `employed by an employer that signed the 2011 framework agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the scale his pay is computed by` IS A STRING @desc the scale's name as annex א' prints it
    `his pay is linked to a judicial officer's` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p4
GIVEN e IS A `2011 framework employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 framework agreement covers` e IF
        e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2011 framework agreement`
    AND elem (e's `the scale his pay is computed by`) `the scales annex א' of the 2011 framework lists`
    AND NOT (    e's `his pay is linked to a judicial officer's`
             AND elem (e's `the scale his pay is computed by`) `the annex א' scales that leave out one linked to a judicial officer`)

`the scales §3 of the 2011 framework keeps out` MEANS
    LIST "עובדים סוציאליים", "שירות החוץ", "פרקליטים", "מחקר אזרחי", "רופאים וטרינרים"

-- ¶2: the payments that allocate the cost frame, under this agreement and
-- the agreements of §10, go to an employee employed in the months they are
-- paid.
@ref akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN `employed in the month of the payment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allocation payment of the 2011 framework goes to the employee` `employed in the month of the payment` IF
    `employed in the month of the payment`

-- ¶3: §§11 (day care), 12 (pension contributions) and 16 (havraa pay)
-- reach too one whose pay is linked to a judicial officer's and who is in
-- the jurists' or the public defenders' scale.
@ref akn:art_3/p3
`the sections that reach a jurist linked to a judicial officer's pay` MEANS LIST 11, 12, 16

GIVEN `the section` IS A NUMBER, e IS A `2011 framework employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a section of the 2011 framework reaches` `the section` e IF
        `the 2011 framework agreement covers` e
    OR (    e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2011 framework agreement`
        AND e's `his pay is linked to a judicial officer's`
        AND elem (e's `the scale his pay is computed by`) `the annex א' scales that leave out one linked to a judicial officer`
        AND elem `the section` `the sections that reach a jurist linked to a judicial officer's pay`)

§§ `4–5 מסגרת עלות התוספות והקצאתה`

-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.
-- akn:art_5 The heading of §5.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-1 The heading of 4.1: in the State's service and among the other employers.

-- 4.1 ¶2: the cost frame of the wage supplements and the money benefits
-- for 1.1.2009–30.6.2012, in the State's service and among the other
-- employers that signed: 4.1.1–4.1.3, 1.7857% for each of 2009, 2010 and
-- 2011; 4.1.4, 0.8929% for 1.1–30.6.2012. 4.1.1 ¶2: a body or scale whose
-- mechanism for updating the salary determining a budgetary pension was
-- not changed by the principles of amendment no. 50 to the State Service
-- (Pensions) Law has no cost for 2009 at this stage, until the matter is
-- settled or the employer and the Histadrut agree otherwise, and approval
-- is given under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law. §4 ¶1: the frame is
-- allocated by the dates and spread of §5.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4 akn:art_4/p1
`the 2011 framework cost frame for each of 2009, 2010 and 2011` MEANS 1.7857%
`the 2011 framework cost frame for the first half of 2012` MEANS 0.8929%

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework cost frame for` `the year` `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the year` EQUALS 2009 AND NOT `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` THEN 0
        IF `the year` AT LEAST 2009 AND `the year` AT MOST 2011 THEN `the 2011 framework cost frame for each of 2009, 2010 and 2011`
        IF `the year` EQUALS 2012 THEN `the 2011 framework cost frame for the first half of 2012`
        OTHERWISE 0

`the 2011 framework cost frame in all` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN y YIELD `the 2011 framework cost frame for` y TRUE) (LIST 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012))

-- 5.1: the frame is allocated at three dates, each on the base of §6
-- (¶2): 5.1.1 from 1.1.2011, 2.25%, allocated in full by §9 (¶2), and to
-- the bodies of 4.1.1's last paragraph too (¶3); 5.1.2 from 1.1.2012,
-- completed to 4.25% — not, at this stage, for those bodies (¶2); 5.1.3
-- from 1.1.2013, completed to 6.25%. "השלמה ל-" makes the figure the
-- whole allocation from its day.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-1 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-1/p2 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-1/p3 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-2 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-2/p2 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_5-1-3 akn:art_5__para_5-1/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework allocation on` d `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) AND `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` THEN 6.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) AND `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` THEN 4.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) THEN 2.25%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- 5.2: a one-time grant is agreed as well, by the wages commissioner's
-- circulars הע 2010-1-47 of 15.11.2010 and הע 2010-1-58 of 19.12.2010
-- (annex ב'); ¶2: the other employers that signed apply those circulars,
-- as the wages commissioner's approval of 15.11.2010 sets out.
@ref akn:art_5__para_5-2 akn:art_5__para_5-2/p2
`the 2011 framework agrees the one-time grant of annex ב'` MEANS TRUE

§§ `6–8 הבסיס, החישוב ושכר המינימום`

-- akn:art_6 The heading of §6.
-- akn:art_7 The heading of §7.
-- akn:art_8 The heading of §8.

-- 6.1: the salary base of the cost frame is the monthly average over
-- January–December 2010 of the combined salary, the seniority supplement,
-- every cost-of-living increment paid to 31.12.2010, and the supplements
-- in shekels and in percent, save (1) those not paid monthly, weekly or
-- daily, (2) those not updated by the cost-of-living agreements with a
-- mechanism of their own, (3) the top-up to the minimum wage. 6.2: for the
-- avoidance of doubt, overtime (shifts, duty, standby, call-outs and
-- incentive pay) and the supplements, yearly supplements and grants
-- derived from the hour value's salary, the combined salary or the
-- budgetary pension's are in it. 6.3: expense reimbursements are not.
-- 6.4: only components paid in January–December 2010, in whole or in part;
-- one first paid after December 2010 is not, unless agreed otherwise.
@ref akn:art_6__para_6-1 akn:art_6__para_6-1/p2 akn:art_6__para_6-1__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_6-1__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_6-1__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_6-2 akn:art_6__para_6-2__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_6-2__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_6-3 akn:art_6__para_6-4
DECLARE `kind of 2011 framework pay component` IS ONE OF
    `the combined salary, the seniority supplement or a cost-of-living increment`
    `overtime, shifts, duty, standby, call-outs or incentive pay`
    `a supplement, yearly supplement or grant derived from the hour value's, the combined or the pension salary`
    `another supplement`
    `an expense reimbursement`

@desc A pay component, as §§6 and 9 tell them apart.
DECLARE `2011 framework pay component` HAS
    `its kind`                                  IS A `kind of 2011 framework pay component`
    `paid monthly, weekly or daily`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `updated by the cost-of-living agreements`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc false where it has a mechanism of its own
    `a minimum-wage top-up`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `paid in 2010`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `counted for the hour value`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `bound to the hour value or the pension salary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc affected by the hour value, or updated with the salary determining the pension

GIVEN c IS A `2011 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one of §6.1's three exceptions` c IF
       NOT c's `paid monthly, weekly or daily`
    OR NOT c's `updated by the cost-of-living agreements`
    OR c's `a minimum-wage top-up`

GIVEN c IS A `2011 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the base of the 2011 framework cost frame` c IF
        c's `paid in 2010`
    AND (CONSIDER c's `its kind`
         WHEN `the combined salary, the seniority supplement or a cost-of-living increment` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `overtime, shifts, duty, standby, call-outs or incentive pay` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a supplement, yearly supplement or grant derived from the hour value's, the combined or the pension salary` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `another supplement` THEN NOT `one of §6.1's three exceptions` c
         WHEN `an expense reimbursement` THEN FALSE)

-- The base is a monthly average of the twelve months of 2010.
GIVEN `the twelve months of 2010` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework salary base from` `the twelve months of 2010` IS
    sum `the twelve months of 2010` DIVIDED BY 12

-- 6.5: a claim of the Histadrut that a supplement of 6.1(1)–(3) belongs in
-- the base goes to the follow-up committee of §21.
@ref akn:art_6__para_6-5
`a claim on §6.1's exceptions goes to the follow-up committee` MEANS TRUE

-- §7 ¶1: the computation of §5 is made for each Histadrut and national
-- union apart; ¶2: and for each employer apart — for this computation
-- alone, all the local authorities the Centre of Local Government
-- represents with the three large cities are one employer, and so are all
-- the universities.
@ref akn:art_7/p1 akn:art_7/p2
DECLARE `employer of the 2011 framework` IS ONE OF
    `the State as an employer of the framework`
    `a local authority or one of the three large cities`
    `a university`
    `another employer of the framework` HAS `its name` IS A STRING

GIVEN e IS AN `employer of the 2011 framework`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the employer §7 computes the cost for` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `the State as an employer of the framework` THEN "המדינה"
    WHEN `a local authority or one of the three large cities` THEN "הרשויות המקומיות ושלוש הערים הגדולות"
    WHEN `a university` THEN "האוניברסיטאות"
    WHEN `another employer of the framework` n THEN n

-- §8 ¶1: the supplements agreed within the frame are not counted for the
-- top-up to the minimum wage under the Minimum Wage Law, 1987; ¶2: but
-- where an existing supplement that is counted for it is raised, ¶1 does
-- not apply to it — which takes nothing from the frame.
@ref akn:art_8/p1 akn:art_8/p2
GIVEN `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 2011 framework supplement counts for the minimum-wage top-up` `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage` IF
    `raises an existing supplement counted for the minimum wage`

`why the Minimum Wage Law is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שכר מינימום, התשמ\"ז-1987"

§§ `9 תוספת 2011`

-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9.

-- 9.1: from 1.1.2011 the employees have a new wage supplement of 2.25%
-- ("תוספת 2011"), at one rate for every employee in every grade; it does
-- not reach the border crossings' and the judges' typists' scales, which
-- §10.6 covers.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-1 akn:art_9__para_9-1/p2 akn:art_9__para_9-1/p3
`the 2011 supplement's first rate` MEANS 2.25%

`the scales §9 leaves to §10.6` MEANS LIST "מעברי הגבול", "קלדניות שופטים"

-- 9.2: the base of תוספת 2011 is the combined salary, the seniority
-- supplement, every cost-of-living increment paid up to its payment, and
-- every supplement counted for the hour value — תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2009
-- among them, for the avoidance of doubt — save 6.1's three exceptions.
-- ¶3: "תוספת 2001" is the 3.6% of the agreement of 31.1.01, at its raised
-- rate where a scale's was raised; ¶4: "תוספת 2009" is every supplement
-- paid under the agreements that allocated the frame of the agreement of
-- 17.4.2008, unless (1)–(3) apply to it. ¶5: this takes nothing from §6.5.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-2 akn:art_9__para_9-2__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_9-2__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_9-2__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_9-2/p2 akn:art_9__para_9-2/p3 akn:art_9__para_9-2/p4 akn:art_9__para_9-2/p5
GIVEN c IS A `2011 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the base of the 2011 supplement` c IF
        NOT `one of §6.1's three exceptions` c
    AND (   c's `its kind` EQUALS `the combined salary, the seniority supplement or a cost-of-living increment`
         OR c's `counted for the hour value`)

`the rate of תוספת 2001 by the agreement of 31.1.01` MEANS 3.6%

-- 9.3: in computing the salary, תוספת 2001 is computed first, on a base
-- without תוספת 2009 and תוספת 2011; then תוספת 2009, on a base without
-- תוספת 2011; then תוספת 2011, on a base with both.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-3
GIVEN `the base without the three` IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary, seniority, the cost-of-living increments and the other supplements of 9.2's base
      `the rate of תוספת 2001` IS A NUMBER @desc 3.6%, or a scale's raised rate
      `תוספת 2009` IS A NUMBER @desc computed on the base with תוספת 2001
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `תוספת 2001 in §9.3's order` `the base without the three` `the rate of תוספת 2001` `תוספת 2009` IS
    `the rate of תוספת 2001` TIMES `the base without the three`

-- 9.4: תוספת 2011 is not counted for the top-up to the minimum wage.
-- 9.5: it is salary for every purpose: the hour value, overtime and the
-- rest of 6.2(1), severance pay under the Severance Pay Law, 1963,
-- pensions, contributions to a pension provident fund and a training fund,
-- and every other contribution usual on the combined salary. 9.6: it is
-- counted for the yearly supplements and grants computed on the hour
-- value's salary or the budgetary pension's. 9.7: the government states
-- that by §8 of the State Service (Pensions) Law it is in the determining
-- salary.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-4 akn:art_9__para_9-5 akn:art_9__para_9-6 akn:art_9__para_9-7
DECLARE `what תוספת 2011 might count for` IS ONE OF
    `the 2011 supplement's minimum-wage top-up`
    `the 2011 supplement's hour value`
    `overtime, duty, shifts, call-outs and incentive pay`
    `severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    `pensions and the determining salary`
    `pension provident-fund contributions`
    `training-fund contributions`
    `other contributions usual on the combined salary`
    `yearly supplements and grants on the hour value's or the pension salary`

GIVEN p IS A `what תוספת 2011 might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `תוספת 2011 counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `the 2011 supplement's minimum-wage top-up`

-- The supplement's rate for a scale, as 9.1 sets it and §10.3–10.4 raise
-- it where no agreement under §10.1 allocated a step by its day: the full
-- cost of the step (2%) goes to it, uniformly, from the step's day.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement's rate on` d `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` IS
    IF NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement's first rate`
         PLUS (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) AND NOT `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011`
               THEN `the cost of a step the 2011 framework puts into the supplement`
               ELSE 0)
         PLUS (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) AND NOT `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012`
               THEN `the cost of a step the 2011 framework puts into the supplement`
               ELSE 0)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the base` IS A NUMBER @desc 9.2's base, תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2009 in it
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `תוספת 2011 on` d `the base` `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` IS
    `the 2011 supplement's rate on` d `an agreement allocated 5.1.2's cost by 30.11.2011` `an agreement allocated 5.1.3's cost by 30.11.2012` TIMES `the base`

-- 9.8: from 1.1.2011 the supplements that (1) are not counted for the hour
-- value, (2) are none of 9.2's three exceptions, and (3) are not bound to
-- the hour value nor updated with the pension's determining salary, grow
-- by 2.25% (relatively: convention amounts.increase); ¶2: not an expense
-- reimbursement of any kind.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-8 akn:art_9__para_9-8__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_9-8__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_9-8__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_9-8/p2
GIVEN c IS A `2011 framework pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§9.8 raises` c IF
        NOT c's `counted for the hour value`
    AND NOT `one of §6.1's three exceptions` c
    AND NOT c's `bound to the hour value or the pension salary`
    AND NOT c's `its kind` EQUALS `an expense reimbursement`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, c IS A `2011 framework pay component`, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a supplement under §9.8 on` d c amount IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) AND `§9.8 raises` c
    THEN amount `increased by` `the 2011 supplement's first rate`
    ELSE amount

-- 9.9: what the section gives is paid from the salary for January 2011
-- and by the salary for February 2011 at the latest (convention
-- dates.salary-month); if paid from February's, January's differences are
-- paid with it.
@ref akn:art_9__para_9-9
`paying תוספת 2011` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 2011 supplement from the January 2011 salary`
    LEST  (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `pay the January 2011 differences with the February 2011 salary`)

`the latest salary month תוספת 2011 starts with` MEANS LIST 2011, 2

§§ `10 משא ומתן נוסף ודירוגים ייחודיים`

-- akn:art_10 The heading of §10.

-- 10.1: soon after the signing the employers negotiate with each
-- Histadrut and union an agreement to carry out §§5–8, within the frame and
-- §6's base, save the cost 5.1.1 allocated and §9 spent (no deadline:
-- convention dates.no-deadline). ¶2: for an employer under §29 of the
-- Budget Foundations Law (imported), subject to §29.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-1/p2
`negotiating the allocation of the 2011 frame` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `negotiate an agreement allocating the cost frame`

-- 10.2: each employer passes the Histadrut the salary data it holds that
-- the negotiation needs and the Histadrut asks for, subject to the law —
-- the Protection of Privacy Law, 1981, among it, with no identifying
-- details; ¶2: as the employer holds it, unprocessed. ¶3: a request that
-- needs processing the employer thinks reasonable is examined favourably;
-- if the employer agrees, it tells the Histadrut the estimated cost; the
-- Histadrut answers whether it bears it; if it does, the data are produced
-- and delivered against payment; if not, the request goes no further.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-2/p2
`transferring the salary data` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `transfer the salary data the Histadrut asks for`

@ref akn:art_10__para_10-2/p3
GIVEN `the processing is reasonable to the employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 framework action`
DECIDE `a request to process salary data` `the processing is reasonable to the employer` IS
    IF `the processing is reasonable to the employer`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `examine a request to process salary data favourably`
         HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
                MUST  `tell the Histadrut the estimated cost of processing the data`
                HENCE (PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
                       MUST  `tell the employer whether the Histadrut bears that cost`))
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `the Histadrut bears the cost` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 framework action`
DECIDE `producing the processed data` `the Histadrut bears the cost` IS
    IF `the Histadrut bears the cost`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `produce and deliver the processed data against payment`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 10.3–10.4: where by 30.11.2011 no agreement under 10.1 allocates
-- 5.1.2's cost for a scale, its whole cost raises תוספת 2011 uniformly for
-- every employee in that scale, its other rules unchanged, and there is no
-- more negotiation on it: from 1.1.2012, 2.25% to 4.25% (¶2). So with
-- 30.11.2012 and 5.1.3's cost: from 1.1.2013, 4.25% to 6.25% (¶2, "for
-- example"). The rate is `the 2011 supplement's rate on`, above.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-3 akn:art_10__para_10-3/p2 akn:art_10__para_10-4 akn:art_10__para_10-4/p2
`the cost of a step the 2011 framework puts into the supplement` MEANS 2%

`the last day to allocate 5.1.2's cost` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2011
`the last day to allocate 5.1.3's cost` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2012

-- 10.5: no agreement under §10 pays anything for work before 1.1.2011.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-5
GIVEN `the work was done on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a §10 agreement may pay for work done on` `the work was done on` IF
    `the work was done on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)

-- 10.6: the special scales, with which no negotiation is held. 10.6.1: the
-- border crossings in the State's service, under §15 of the agreement of
-- 2.3.2009 (outside the corpus): the basic salary table of its annex
-- stands at 102.25% of its amounts from 1.1.2011, 104.25% from 1.1.2012
-- and 106.25% from 1.1.2013. 10.6.2: the judges' typists, following §6.3
-- of their agreement of 28.12.2009 (outside the corpus): the whole 6.25%
-- goes to their basic salary, annex א''s table at the same three figures.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-6 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-1 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-1/p2 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-1/p3 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-1/p4 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-2 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-2/p2 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-2/p3 akn:art_10__para_10-6__subpara_10-6-2/p4
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of their table a special scale is paid on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN 106.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN 104.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) THEN 102.25%
        OTHERWISE 100%

`why the special scales' tables are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הנספח להסכם הקיבוצי מיום 2.3.2009 (מעברי הגבול) ונספח א' להסכם הקיבוצי מיום 28.12.2009 (קלדניות שופטים): טבלאות שכר היסוד"

§§ `11 זכויות הוריות – תוספת מעונות`

-- akn:art_11 The heading of §11.

-- ¶1: from 1.9.2011 a reimbursement of the expense of keeping a child in
-- day care ("תוספת מעונות") is paid, as follows. 11.1: for a partial
-- share in the expense of day care or other supervision, by the conditions
-- below; ¶2: a "child" is one who has not yet turned five, unless said
-- otherwise expressly. 11.2: it is paid to an employee who is a mother of
-- a child, and she is asked for no receipts.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-1/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-2
`the 2011 framework day-care supplement starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011
`the age a child of the 2011 framework has not yet reached` MEANS 5

GIVEN `a mother` IS A BOOLEAN, `the child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the 2011 framework day-care supplement for the child` `a mother` `the child's age in whole years` IF
    `a mother` AND `the child's age in whole years` LESS THAN `the age a child of the 2011 framework has not yet reached`

`the 2011 framework asks the mother for receipts` MEANS FALSE

-- 11.3: 300 a month for one child or the first; 200 for a second; ¶2:
-- paid at once for two children at most.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-3 akn:art_11__para_11-3__subpara_11-3-1 akn:art_11__para_11-3__subpara_11-3-2 akn:art_11__para_11-3/p2
`the 2011 framework day-care supplement for one or a first child` MEANS 300
`the 2011 framework day-care supplement for a second child` MEANS 200

GIVEN `children under five` IS A NUMBER, `for a first child` IS A NUMBER, `for a second child` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 framework day-care supplement for` `children under five` `for a first child` `for a second child` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `children under five` AT LEAST 2 THEN `for a first child` PLUS `for a second child`
        IF `children under five` AT LEAST 1 THEN `for a first child`
        OTHERWISE 0

-- 11.4: from January 2012 the amounts are updated once a year, with the
-- January salary, by the change between the new index and the previous
-- one: the price index the Central Bureau of Statistics publishes;
-- December's of the year before the update month, against December's of
-- the year before the previous update's month (for the first, December
-- 2010's). Each update applies to the amount in force on its day
-- (convention dates.update-in-force), exactly (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-4 akn:art_11__para_11-4/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-4/p3 akn:art_11__para_11-4/p4 akn:art_11__para_11-4/p5
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the December indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc from December 2010 to the December before the last January update, in order
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a 2011 framework day-care amount updated each January` amount `the December indices` IS
    CONSIDER `the December indices`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN amount
    WHEN previous FOLLOWED BY later THEN
        CONSIDER later
        WHEN EMPTY THEN amount
        WHEN new FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `a 2011 framework day-care amount updated each January` (amount TIMES new DIVIDED BY previous) later

-- 11.5.1: it is paid only for a time she is entitled to salary from the
-- employer and funded by it: not for a time of maternity pay under the
-- National Insurance Law, nor for unpaid leave. 11.5.2: it is a component
-- of expense reimbursement, so not salary for every purpose, and the
-- contributions on an expense-reimbursement component are made on it; for
-- an employer under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law, subject to §29.
-- 11.5.3: it is a "right connected with parenthood" under §4(ב) of the
-- Equal Employment Opportunities Law, 1988, and §4(א) applies to it
-- (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-5 akn:art_11__para_11-5__subpara_11-5-1 akn:art_11__para_11-5__subpara_11-5-2 akn:art_11__para_11-5__subpara_11-5-3
`the 2011 framework day-care supplement is salary` MEANS FALSE
`the 2011 framework day-care supplement carries an expense reimbursement's contributions` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 framework pays day care for the time` `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the time` IF
    `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the time`

`why the Equal Employment Opportunities Law is not in §11` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שוויון ההזדמנויות בעבודה, התשמ\"ח-1988, סעיף 4"

-- 11.6: from the salary of September 2011 it replaces and cancels every
-- other arrangement on a child under five, whatever its name. 11.7: not
-- where a general arrangement — of the scale, the employer, the workplace
-- or the area — pays (1) another benefit for day care (2) above 300 a
-- month for one child and above 500 for two or more, both ("עולה על":
-- convention thresholds.above); ¶2: then it goes on, by its own rules and
-- standing, judged of the arrangement and not of the employee; ¶3: a
-- disagreement goes to the follow-up committee of §21 (no deadline:
-- convention dates.no-deadline); ¶4: subject to §29 for an employer under
-- it. 11.8: arrangements of a scale or an employer for children of five
-- and over go on for those ages, as on the signing day, with no double
-- arrangement; subject to §29 likewise.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-6 akn:art_11__para_11-7 akn:art_11__para_11-7__subpara_1 akn:art_11__para_11-7__subpara_2 akn:art_11__para_11-7/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-7/p4
GIVEN `it pays another benefit for day care` IS A BOOLEAN
      `its benefit for one or a first child` IS A NUMBER
      `its benefit for two children or more` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a general arrangement the 2011 framework keeps` `it pays another benefit for day care` `its benefit for one or a first child` `its benefit for two children or more` IF
        `it pays another benefit for day care`
    AND `its benefit for one or a first child` `is above` 300
    AND `its benefit for two children or more` `is above` 500

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-7/p3
`deciding a day-care disagreement under the 2011 framework` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `decide a disagreement over a general day-care arrangement under the framework`

@ref akn:art_11__para_11-8
GIVEN `the child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an older child's day-care arrangement goes on under the 2011 framework` `the child's age in whole years` IF
    `the child's age in whole years` AT LEAST `the age a child of the 2011 framework has not yet reached`

§§ `12 הפרשות לקופת גמל לקצבה`

-- akn:art_12 The heading of §12.

-- 12.1: for the State and the employers under the collective agreement of
-- 3.3.99 on the move from a budgetary to an accrual pension, see annex ג',
-- a collective agreement amending it (below).
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-1
`§12.1 of the 2011 framework sends to annex ג'` MEANS TRUE

-- 12.2: for the employers that agreement does not reach, the rates grow.
-- (א) on the salary insured for an accrual pension: (1) in a new accrual
-- pension fund, (א) from 1.1.2011 the employer's for benefits grows by
-- 0.5% to no more than 6.5%, and the employee's deduction by 0.5% or what
-- completes it to 6%, the lower; ¶4: carried out from the salary of
-- February 2011, by March 2011's, back to 1.1.2011; (ב) from 1.1.2013 by
-- 0.5% more, to no more than 7%, and the deduction by 0.5% more or to
-- 6.5%, the lower. A rate already above the cap does not fall, and what
-- completes a deduction is never below nothing (convention
-- amounts.never-negative).
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_a akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_a/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_a/p3 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_a/p4 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_b akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_b/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_1__pnt_b/p3
GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER, cap IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` rate cap IS
    max rate (min (rate PLUS 0.5%) cap)

GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER, ceiling IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a deduction grown by half a point or to` rate ceiling IS
    rate PLUS min (0.5%) (`not below zero` (ceiling MINUS rate))

@desc The rates of a provident fund for an employee, as fractions of the salary.
DECLARE `2011 framework fund rates` HAS
    `the employer's for benefits` IS A NUMBER
    `the employee's deduction`    IS A NUMBER

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS A `2011 framework fund rates`
GIVETH A `2011 framework fund rates`
DECIDE `the rates in a new accrual pension fund under §12.2 on` d `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
    THEN `2011 framework fund rates` WITH
             `the employer's for benefits` IS `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` (after2011's `the employer's for benefits`) (7%)
             `the employee's deduction`    IS `a deduction grown by half a point or to` (after2011's `the employee's deduction`) (6.5%)
    ELSE IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)
         THEN after2011
         ELSE `the rates on 31.12.2010`
    WHERE
        after2011 MEANS
            `2011 framework fund rates` WITH
                `the employer's for benefits` IS `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` (`the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employer's for benefits`) (6.5%)
                `the employee's deduction`    IS `a deduction grown by half a point or to` (`the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employee's deduction`) (6%)

-- (2) in managers' insurance or a provident fund that pays no annuity
-- ("תגמולים ופיצויים"), where the employer's whole rate for benefits and
-- disability insurance is below 7.5% and the deduction below 7%, each
-- grows by 0.5% from 1.1.2011 (carried out like (1)) and by 0.5% more from
-- 1.1.2013; ¶3: never above 7.5% and 7%; ¶4: the employer's rises even
-- where the employee's deduction, at his request, is 7% on the signing
-- day.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2__pnt_1 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2__pnt_1/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2__pnt_2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2/p3 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_a__cls_2/p4
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS A `2011 framework fund rates` @desc the employer's: benefits and disability insurance together
GIVETH A `2011 framework fund rates`
DECIDE `the rates in managers' insurance under §12.2 on` d `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS
    `2011 framework fund rates` WITH
        `the employer's for benefits` IS IF later THEN `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` employer1 (7.5%) ELSE employer1
        `the employee's deduction`    IS IF later THEN `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` employee1 (7%) ELSE employee1
    WHERE
        started MEANS d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)
        later MEANS d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
        employer0 MEANS `the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employer's for benefits`
        employee0 MEANS `the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employee's deduction`
        employer1 MEANS IF started THEN `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` employer0 (7.5%) ELSE employer0
        employee1 MEANS IF started THEN `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` employee0 (7%) ELSE employee0

-- (ב) on the salary components not in the salary insured for an accrual
-- pension and not expense reimbursements, from 1.1.2011, the rates of
-- contribution to a pension provident fund grow — save clothing, where the
-- employer leaves it out of the insured salary, and save expense
-- reimbursements: (1) from 1.1.2011 the employer's for benefits by 0.5%, to
-- no more than 5.5%; the deduction by 0.5% or to 5.5%, the lower; ¶3:
-- carried out like (א)(1); (2) from 1.1.2013 by 0.5% more, to 6%, and the
-- deduction likewise to 6%.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:art_12__para_12-2__subpara_b__cls_2/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS A `2011 framework fund rates`
GIVETH A `2011 framework fund rates`
DECIDE `the rates on uninsured components under §12.2(ב) on` d `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
    THEN `2011 framework fund rates` WITH
             `the employer's for benefits` IS `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` (after2011's `the employer's for benefits`) (6%)
             `the employee's deduction`    IS `a deduction grown by half a point or to` (after2011's `the employee's deduction`) (6%)
    ELSE IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)
         THEN after2011
         ELSE `the rates on 31.12.2010`
    WHERE
        after2011 MEANS
            `2011 framework fund rates` WITH
                `the employer's for benefits` IS `an employer's rate grown by half a point to` (`the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employer's for benefits`) (5.5%)
                `the employee's deduction`    IS `a deduction grown by half a point or to` (`the rates on 31.12.2010`'s `the employee's deduction`) (5.5%)

`raising the contributions of 1.1.2011` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `raise the pension contributions of 1.1.2011 with the February or March 2011 salary`

-- 12.3: nothing in the section approves a benefit against §29 of the
-- Budget Foundations Law, the components that are a base for pension
-- contributions among them.
@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3
`§12 of the 2011 framework is an approval under §29` MEANS FALSE

§§ `13 יום בחירה בתחילת שנת הלימודים`

-- akn:art_13 The heading of §13.

-- ¶1: the first day of the school year is one of the days that may be
-- taken as a day of choice, from the quota of such days as the workplace
-- has them. ¶2: not for employees employed in the education system. ¶3: it
-- makes no right to days of choice where no arrangement has them.
@ref akn:art_13/p1 akn:art_13/p2 akn:art_13/p3
GIVEN `employed in the education system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the workplace has days of choice` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may take the first school day as a day of choice` `employed in the education system` `the workplace has days of choice` IF
    `the workplace has days of choice` AND (NOT `employed in the education system`)

§§ `14 גמלאים בפנסיה תקציבית`

-- akn:art_14 The heading of §14.

-- 14.1: the Treasury states it will soon circulate a bill amending the
-- State Service (Pensions) Law on these principles: 14.1.1 it reaches one
-- who retired between 1.1.2009 and 31.12.2012 and, on the eve, was in a
-- scale of annex א' that exists in the State's service ("פורש זכאי");
-- 14.1.2 the determining salary of an eligible retiree, or of his
-- survivor, grows by the rate annex ד''s table gives for his month of
-- retirement, at the dates of 14.1.3: 14.1.3.1 from 1.1.2011 (January
-- 2011's pension) by column A, for retirement in 1.1.2009–31.12.2010;
-- 14.1.3.2 from 1.1.2012 by column B, for retirement in
-- 1.4.2010–31.12.2011, and (¶2) on a base with 14.1.3.1's rise where both
-- apply; 14.1.3.3 from 1.1.2013 by column C, for retirement in
-- 1.5.2011–31.12.2012, and (¶2) on a base with 14.1.3.2's. Each rise grows
-- the salary relatively (convention amounts.increase); a month whose cell
-- the corpus cannot read gives no rise (`the text is missing`).
-- 14.1.3.2 ¶2's "14.1.31" is a corpus sic, read as 14.1.3.1 (its note).
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-2 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3__cls_14-1-3-1 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3__cls_14-1-3-2 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3__cls_14-1-3-2/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3__cls_14-1-3-3 akn:art_14__para_14-1__subpara_14-1-3__cls_14-1-3-3/p2
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible retiree under §14.1.1` `retired on` `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve` IF
        `in an annex א' scale of the State's service on the eve`
    AND `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009)
    AND `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012)

GIVEN `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER
      `retired in year` IS A NUMBER
      `retired in month` IS A NUMBER
      `the pension month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining salary raised under §14 for` `the determining salary` `retired in year` `retired in month` `the pension month` IS
    CONSIDER `the annex ד' row for` `retired in year` `retired in month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST r THEN
        CONSIDER r's `column C`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN (IF `the pension month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN NOTHING ELSE JUST withB)
        WHEN JUST c THEN JUST (IF `the pension month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN withB `increased by` c ELSE withB)
        WHERE
            withA MEANS IF `the pension month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) THEN `the determining salary` `increased by` (r's `column A`) ELSE `the determining salary`
            withB MEANS IF `the pension month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN withA `increased by` (r's `column B`) ELSE withA

-- 14.2: the Histadrut states that (14.2.1) it accepts the principles and
-- supports the legislation, and (14.2.2) once the Knesset passes it, it
-- demands no further rise of the determining salary, nor a supplement or
-- benefit, for the rises of this agreement or of §10's, or for the time to
-- 30.6.2012.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_14-2-1 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_14-2-2
`circulating the pensions bill` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `circulate the bill amending the Pensions Law`

GIVEN `the Knesset passed the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 framework action`
DECIDE `the Histadrut's pension undertakings` `the Knesset passed the amendment` IS
    IF `the Knesset passed the amendment`
    THEN PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
         SHANT `demand a further rise for the period to 30.6.2012`
    ELSE PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
         MAY   `support the bill amending the Pensions Law`

-- 14.3: the Histadrut and the Centre of Local Government, the three large
-- cities, the Centre of Regional Councils (named twice), the fire-service
-- associations, the National Insurance Institute, the Employment Service
-- and Israel Post agree that the amendment reaches them too, by the same
-- rules and dates, the Pensions Law applying there by law, agreement or
-- arrangement, fitted to their scales of annex א'.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-3
`the employers §14.3 brings under the pensions amendment` MEANS
    LIST "מרכז השלטון המקומי", "שלוש הערים הגדולות", "מרכז המועצות האזוריות", "איגודי הערים לכבאות", "המוסד לביטוח לאומי", "שירות התעסוקה", "חברת דואר ישראל בע\"מ"

-- 14.4: "משכורת קובעת" is as defined "בסעיף לחוק הגמלאות" — the section's
-- number left out (F-framework-2011-c) — save havraa and clothing; the
-- jubilee grant is not in it. 14.5: an eligible retiree, or his survivor,
-- entitled to a jubilee grant has it raised at the dates and the rate of
-- his determining salary; ¶2: "מענק יובל" as in chapter 25.5 of the
-- Takshir and the like with the other employers; ¶3: the day it is paid
-- does not change. The Pensions Law and the Takshir are outside the
-- corpus.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-4 akn:art_14__para_14-5 akn:art_14__para_14-5/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-5/p3
DECLARE `what the pensions' determining salary might take in` IS ONE OF
    `the salary components the Pensions Law counts`
    `the havraa allowance`
    `the clothing allowance`
    `the jubilee grant`

GIVEN p IS A `what the pensions' determining salary might take in`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§14.4's determining salary takes in` p IF
    p EQUALS `the salary components the Pensions Law counts`

`the section of the Pensions Law §14.4 names` MEANS ""

GIVEN `the jubilee grant` IS A NUMBER
      `the determining salary before the rise` IS A NUMBER
      `the determining salary after the rise` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an eligible retiree's jubilee grant under §14.5` `the jubilee grant` `the determining salary before the rise` `the determining salary after the rise` IS
    `the jubilee grant` TIMES `the determining salary after the rise` DIVIDED BY `the determining salary before the rise`

`why the Pensions Law and the Takshir are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות) [נוסח משולב], התש\"ל-1970, ותיקון מס' 50 לו; פרק 25.5 לתקשי\"ר"

-- 14.6: the section is for the employers with a budgetary pension alone:
-- the other employers, and their employees, get no other benefit, directly
-- or not, for it or its cost, and no claim. 14.7: it approves no benefit
-- against §29, the computing of the determining salary or the pension
-- among it.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-6
GIVEN `the employer has a budgetary pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 framework action`
DECIDE `a benefit for §14's cost` `the employer has a budgetary pension` IS
    IF `the employer has a budgetary pension`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `give another benefit for the pensioners' rise`

@ref akn:art_14__para_14-7
`§14 of the 2011 framework is an approval under §29` MEANS FALSE

§§ `15–16 מבנה העסקה ודמי הבראה`

-- akn:art_15 The heading of §15.
-- akn:art_16 The heading of §16.

-- 15.1: the talks on the structure of employment go on; 15.2: the parties
-- recognise the worth of better service and will cooperate in it; 15.3:
-- those are not matters this agreement settles, each side keeps its
-- claims and may act by its means.
@ref akn:art_15__para_15-1 akn:art_15__para_15-2 akn:art_15__para_15-3
`going on with the structure-of-employment talks` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `go on discussing the structure of employment`

`cooperating to improve the service` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `cooperate to improve the service`

`the 2011 framework settles the structure of employment` MEANS FALSE

-- 16.1: the Treasury states it will soon circulate a bill amending the
-- havraa law of 2009 (outside the corpus) on these principles: (1) no
-- further reduction under it; (2) what it took off in 2010 is paid back,
-- save where the 2009 reduction (half the full havraa pay) was not made;
-- (3) following the agreements of 16.6.2009 and 7.6.2010 and the follow-up
-- committee's decisions, and differing from them, the reduction made
-- under them from 1.1.2009 to this signing exhausts the whole reduction,
-- and none is made in 2011 — subject to the bill's enactment.
@ref akn:art_16__para_16-1 akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_1 akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_2 akn:art_16__para_16-1__subpara_3
`circulating the havraa bill` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `circulate the bill amending the havraa law`

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER, `the bill was enacted` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§16.1(3) leaves a further havraa reduction possible in` `the year` `the bill was enacted` IF
    `the year` AT LEAST 2011 AND (NOT `the bill was enacted`)

GIVEN `the 2010 reduction` IS A NUMBER, `the 2009 reduction was made` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2010 havraa reduction paid back` `the 2010 reduction` `the 2009 reduction was made` IS
    IF `the 2009 reduction was made` THEN `the 2010 reduction` ELSE 0

`why the havraa law is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החוק לתשלום חלקי של דמי הבראה בשירות הציבורי בשנים 2009 ו-2010 (הוראת שעה), התשס\"ט-2009"

§§ `17–22 סכסוכים, מיצוי, שקט, הסכמים קודמים, ועדת מעקב ובוררות`

-- akn:art_17 The heading of §17.
-- akn:art_18 The heading of §18.
-- akn:art_19 The heading of §19.
-- akn:art_20 The heading of §20.
-- akn:art_21 The heading of §21.
-- akn:art_22 The heading of §22.

-- §17: the collective disputes, national and local, on what it settles are
-- void on signing — that of 7.10.2010, on the update of public-sector pay,
-- among them.
@ref akn:art_17/p1 akn:art_17/p2
`the disputes on the 2011 framework's matters stand` MEANS FALSE

-- 18.1: the agreement exhausts all the parties' claims, national and
-- local, on enlarging the cost frame or any further benefit, for the time
-- to 30.6.2012; 18.2: that, and industrial peace, do not reach (1) claims
-- pending before the agreed arbitration institution or in the courts, nor
-- (2) pending economic disputes declared lawfully before the signing and
-- not exhausted or cancelled. ¶: subject to that and to §10, no further
-- negotiation on wages or benefits, at any level, for that time, for the
-- employees it covers.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-1 akn:art_18__para_18-2 akn:art_18__para_18-2__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_18-2__subpara_2 akn:art_18/p1
GIVEN `pending in arbitration or a court` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 framework exhausts the claim` `pending in arbitration or a court` `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing` d IF
        d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2012)
    AND NOT `pending in arbitration or a court`
    AND NOT `a pending economic dispute declared before the signing`

`no further wage negotiation for the time to 30.6.2012` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `negotiate further on pay for the period to 30.6.2012`

-- §19: in the agreement's period the Histadrut does not strike, in full or
-- in part, nor harm the work in an organised way, over what it settles.
@ref akn:art_19/p1
`industrial peace under the 2011 framework` MEANS
    PARTY `the New General Histadrut`
    SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 2011 framework agreement settled`

-- §20: earlier terms stand for its period unless it amends or cancels
-- them.
@ref akn:art_20/p1
`earlier terms stand unless the 2011 framework changes them` MEANS TRUE

-- §21: a follow-up committee of the wages commissioner and the chair of
-- the Histadrut's trade union division goes on following and helping to
-- carry out the agreement, and decides the disagreements on it; its
-- decisions are final and bind the parties.
@ref akn:art_21/p1 akn:art_21/p2
`deciding disputes over the 2011 framework` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `decide disputes over the 2011 framework agreement`

`the 2011 follow-up committee's decisions are final` MEANS TRUE

-- §22: the agreement on the agreed arbitration institution in the public
-- services is extended until the next national wage agreement is signed;
-- ¶2: it reaches the employers that are its parties or joined it.
@ref akn:art_22/p1 akn:art_22/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the next national wage agreement was signed on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the arbitration institution agreement stands on` d `the next national wage agreement was signed on` IS
    CONSIDER `the next national wage agreement was signed on`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST s THEN NOT d `is on or after` s

