§§ `נספח ב' — חוזרי הממונה על השכר על המענק החד פעמי`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The State of Israel, on the circular's letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 The Treasury; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 The wages and labour agreements unit; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 Its address; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 Its Hebrew date; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p6 Its date (15.11.2010); no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p7 The circular's series; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p8 Its number (2010-1-47); no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p9 The addressee, the Accountant General's senior deputy; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p10 The subject: a one-time grant to public-sector employees; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p11 A heading: the draft principles of the 2010 framework agreement; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p12 The history: understandings of 2.11.2010 on the framework agreement's principles; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p13 Since the agreement was not yet signed, the instructions follow; no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p16 The closing; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p17 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p18 The signatory, the wages commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p19 His post; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p20 "Copies"; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p21 A copy to the acting Civil Service Commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p22 A copy to the Histadrut's trade union division; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p23 A copy to the public-sector employers; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p24 A file number; no rule.

-- Circular 2010-1-47, 1.א: an employee of the State whose pay is computed
-- by the agreements of a Histadrut scale its annex א' lists, employed in
-- the State's service on 1.7.2010 and continuously to 1.11.2010, has a
-- one-time grant of 2,000; ¶2: not one in a scale of its annex ב'. 1.ב:
-- that is for a full position; a part-time employee's is in proportion to
-- his average position over 1.11.2009–31.10.2010, and (¶2) one employed in
-- part of that time, but continuously in 1.7.10–1.11.10, by the time he
-- was employed in it.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p2
`the one-time grant of 2010 for a full position` MEANS 2000

GIVEN `in a scale of the circular's annex א'` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed in the State's service from 1.7.2010 to 1.11.2010 continuously` IS A BOOLEAN
      `his average position` IS A NUMBER @desc over 1.11.2009–31.10.2010, or the part of it he was employed
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the one-time grant of 2010` `in a scale of the circular's annex א'` `employed in the State's service from 1.7.2010 to 1.11.2010 continuously` `his average position` IS
    IF `in a scale of the circular's annex א'` AND `employed in the State's service from 1.7.2010 to 1.11.2010 continuously`
    THEN `the one-time grant of 2010 for a full position` `pro rata to a position of` `his average position`
    ELSE 0

-- 1 (the opening): it is paid with the salary of November 2010 (paid in
-- December) and by December 2010's (paid in January 2011) at the latest.
`paying the one-time grant of 2010` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the one-time grant of 2010`

-- 1.ג: the grant is not salary for any purpose, not counted for severance
-- pay or the hour value of overtime (standby, call-outs, duty, shifts and
-- incentive pay among it), and carries no contribution to any fund (a
-- training fund, a pension fund or managers' insurance among them). 1.ג
-- ¶2: the distributor's footer; no rule. 1.ד: for the avoidance of doubt,
-- (1) it is not counted for the top-up to the minimum wage, and (2) it
-- does not change the base of the combined salary table.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2
`the one-time grant of 2010 is salary or carries contributions` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p2 The distributor's footer, printed inside 1.ג; no rule.

-- 1.ה: one paid by the day or the hour: (1) by the hour (students, for
-- instance), a position for the grant of his average monthly hours in
-- 1.11.2009–31.10.2010 divided by 184.17, and (¶2) in part of that time,
-- continuous in 1.7.2010–1.11.2010, by the time he worked; (2) by the day,
-- his average monthly days divided by 20.83 in a five-day week or by 25 in
-- a six-day week, and (¶2) likewise; (3) students are paid with the salary
-- of January 2011 (paid in February) and by February 2011's at the
-- latest, not at the dates of 1's opening.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e__cls_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e__cls_2/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_e__cls_3
GIVEN `his average monthly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position of one paid by the hour, for the grant` `his average monthly hours` IS
    `his average monthly hours` DIVIDED BY 184.17

GIVEN `his average monthly days` IS A NUMBER, `days a week at his workplace` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position of one paid by the day, for the grant` `his average monthly days` `days a week at his workplace` IS
    IF `days a week at his workplace` EQUALS 6
    THEN `his average monthly days` DIVIDED BY 25
    ELSE `his average monthly days` DIVIDED BY 20.83

`the latest salary month students are paid the grant with` MEANS LIST 2011, 2

-- 2: a body or a scale whose updating of the determining salary of a
-- budgetary pension was not changed by amendment 50 is not paid the grant
-- at this stage, until it is settled and approved (in coordination with
-- the Histadrut). 3: the circular was coordinated with the Histadrut; the
-- grant is part of the framework agreement to be signed.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the one-time grant is paid at this stage to a body whose update` `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50` IF
    `the body's pension update was changed by amendment 50`

`the one-time grant is part of the framework agreement` MEANS TRUE

-- ¶14: the bodies about to sign the framework agreement have the wages
-- commissioner's specific approval to pay the grant; ¶15: other public
-- bodies that joined or applied the framework agreement of 17.4.2008 and
-- wish to pay it apply to him in writing.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p14 akn:att_2__hc_1/p15
GIVEN `about to sign the 2011 framework agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `joined or applied the framework agreement of 17.4.2008` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2011 framework action`
DECIDE `a public body paying the one-time grant` `about to sign the 2011 framework agreement` `joined or applied the framework agreement of 17.4.2008` IS
    IF `about to sign the 2011 framework agreement`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MAY   `pay the one-time grant of 2010`
    ELSE IF `joined or applied the framework agreement of 17.4.2008`
         THEN PARTY `the employer`
              MUST  `apply in writing to the wages commissioner to pay the one-time grant`
              HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
                     MAY   `pay the one-time grant of 2010`)
         ELSE FULFILLED

