@ref akn:att_2__att_2__hc_1__para_5__subpara_c__cls_1 akn:att_2__att_2__hc_1__para_5__subpara_c__cls_2
`the second circular's grant is the first circular's` MEANS `the one-time grant is part of the framework agreement`

