-- §1: its preamble is part of it. §2(א): it covers every employee the
-- agreement of 3.3.99 covers (imported: its chapter ג'); (ב): it starts on
-- 1 January 2011.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2__subpara_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2__subpara_b
`the pension-transition amendment starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the determining date` IS A DATE
      s IS A `1999 employee status`
      k IS A `scale chapter ג' leaves out`
      `the workplace had a budgetary track until the determining date` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ג' covers` d `the determining date` s k `the workplace had a budgetary track until the determining date` IF
        d `is on or after` `the pension-transition amendment starts on`
    AND `the 1999 agreement covers` d `the determining date` s k `the workplace had a budgetary track until the determining date`

-- §§3–8: the amendments to the agreement of 3.3.99 (imported): §3
-- strikes the definition of "הסדר פנסיה צוברת" (chapter ב' §3); §4 puts in
-- place of chapter ב' §§6–9 "קרן פנסיה צוברת ותיקה" (an old fund under the
-- Provident Funds Law) and "קרן פנסיה צוברת חדשה" (a new comprehensive or
-- general fund); §5 adds "חוק קופות גמל" (the Financial Services
-- Supervision (Provident Funds) Law, 2005) and "קופת גמל לקצבה" (as it
-- defines one); §6 puts "קופת גמל לקצבה" in place of four terms from
-- chapter ג' on; §8 strikes words in chapter ד' §6(ג). §7 puts in place of
-- chapter ד' §3(א)–(ב): from the determining day contributions to a
-- pension provident fund, of the employee's choice (chapter י'), for
-- permanent employees, on every salary component outside the budgetary
-- pension's determining salary that is not an expense reimbursement, a
-- tax gross-up or a benefit imputed for tax.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_4 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_5 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_6 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_8
`the terms annex ג' defines in the agreement of 3.3.99` MEANS
    LIST "קרן פנסיה צוברת ותיקה", "קרן פנסיה צוברת חדשה", "חוק קופות גמל", "קופת גמל לקצבה"

`the terms annex ג' replaces with "קופת גמל לקצבה"` MEANS
    LIST "קרן פנסיה צוברת", "קופת גמל לתגמולים", "קופת גמל לשכירים", "הסדר פנסיה צוברת"

@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_7
DECLARE `component under annex ג''s §7` IS ONE OF
    `in the budgetary pension's determining salary`
    `an expense reimbursement under annex ג'`
    `a tax gross-up under annex ג'`
    `a benefit imputed for tax under annex ג'`
    `another salary component under annex ג'`

GIVEN c IS A `component under annex ג''s §7`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ג' brings a permanent employee's component into the pension fund` c IF
    c EQUALS `another salary component under annex ג'`

-- §9 (chapter ד' §8 anew): for a permanent employee who chose the
-- alternative arrangement (5% and 5% for benefits and 7% as an independent
-- member) in its earlier wording, from 1.1.2011 contributions and
-- deductions to the provident fund that pays no annuity that he chose for
-- it, as long as he chooses no other: (א) from 1.1.2011 the employer 12.5%,
-- 6.5% for benefits and 6% in place of severance, the employee 5.5%; (ב)
-- "החל ביום 1.12.2013" the employer 13%, 7% and 6%, the employee 6%; (ג)
-- 2010's 12% of the employer's is split 6% and 6%, if (1) the authorities
-- approve it is lawful and (2) it can be done in the same fund; these take
-- the place of the alternative arrangement. F-framework-2011-a: (ב)'s day
-- is 1.12.2013 where every other rise in the agreement and in its annex is
-- 1.1.2013. The reading adopted (convention reading.as-printed): the day
-- as printed.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_9
DECLARE `the alternative arrangement's rates` HAS
    `the employer's for benefits`        IS A NUMBER
    `the employer's in place of severance` IS A NUMBER
    `the employee's for benefits`        IS A NUMBER

`the day annex ג''s §9(ב) raises the alternative arrangement from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2013
`the day every other step of 2013 is taken` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `the alternative arrangement's rates`
DECIDE `the alternative arrangement's rates under annex ג' on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the day annex ג''s §9(ב) raises the alternative arrangement from`
    THEN JUST (`the alternative arrangement's rates` WITH
                  `the employer's for benefits`          IS 7%
                  `the employer's in place of severance` IS 6%
                  `the employee's for benefits`          IS 6%)
    ELSE IF d `is on or after` `the pension-transition amendment starts on`
         THEN JUST (`the alternative arrangement's rates` WITH
                       `the employer's for benefits`          IS 6.5%
                       `the employer's in place of severance` IS 6%
                       `the employee's for benefits`          IS 5.5%)
         ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN `the authorities approved it is lawful` IS A BOOLEAN, `it can be done in the same fund` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `2010's employer contribution is split 6% and 6%` `the authorities approved it is lawful` `it can be done in the same fund` IF
    `the authorities approved it is lawful` AND `it can be done in the same fund`

-- §10 (chapter ה' §3 anew): an existing employee actively insured in
-- managers' insurance on the eve, for the salary that determines his
-- pension, who chose to stay in it from the determining day, and a new
-- employee actively insured in it before he came who told the employer in
-- writing within 14 days and chose to stay: (א) his insurance follows the
-- employer's custom on the eve, as it may be, his rates among it, the
-- existing employee not harmed; the agreement applies to him as fitted —
-- (1) components added to the pension insurance, (2) when the employer
-- may ask the insurer for money back (chapter ט'), (3) where the employer
-- contributes under the order of the Minister of Labour (י"פ 4659), the
-- contributions take the place of severance pay by the order's terms, and
-- the employer may deduct the employee's share; (ב) where the employer's
-- whole rate for benefits and disability insurance is below 7.5% and the
-- deduction below 7%, both grow by 0.5% from 1.1.2011 and by 0.5% more
-- from 1.1.2013, never above 7.5% and 7%: the rule of §12.2(א)(2) of the
-- framework agreement (above); (ג) the employer's rise holds even at a
-- deduction of 7% by request on the signing day; (ד) "actively insured":
-- contributions made for him in the three months before the determining
-- day, or before he came; (ה) one this section does not reach is under
-- chapter ז' §1.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_10
GIVEN `months of contributions in the three before the day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `actively insured in managers' insurance under annex ג'` `months of contributions in the three before the day` IF
    `months of contributions in the three before the day` AT LEAST 3

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS A `2011 framework fund rates`
GIVETH A `2011 framework fund rates`
DECIDE `the managers' insurance rates under annex ג' on` d `the rates on 31.12.2010` IS
    `the rates in managers' insurance under §12.2 on` d `the rates on 31.12.2010`

`the days a new employee has to tell the employer of his managers' insurance` MEANS 14

-- §11 (chapter ז' §1, new (ג)–(ד)): from 1.1.2011 the rates on the salary
-- insured for an accrual pension, in a pension provident fund that is not
-- an old fund, for a permanent employee (chapter ד' §3) and for new and
-- existing ones (chapter ו' §1(א)): (1) from 1.1.2011 the employer 12.5%,
-- 6.5% for benefits and 6% in place of severance, the employee 6%; (2)
-- from 1.1.2013 the employer 13%, 7% and 6%, the employee 6.5%; (ד) not
-- for one in managers' insurance under chapter ה' §3.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_11
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `in managers' insurance under chapter ה' §3` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `the alternative arrangement's rates`
DECIDE `the accrual-pension rates under annex ג' on` d `in managers' insurance under chapter ה' §3` IS
    IF `in managers' insurance under chapter ה' §3`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE IF d `is on or after` `the day every other step of 2013 is taken`
         THEN JUST (`the alternative arrangement's rates` WITH
                       `the employer's for benefits`          IS 7%
                       `the employer's in place of severance` IS 6%
                       `the employee's for benefits`          IS 6.5%)
         ELSE IF d `is on or after` `the pension-transition amendment starts on`
              THEN JUST (`the alternative arrangement's rates` WITH
                            `the employer's for benefits`          IS 6.5%
                            `the employer's in place of severance` IS 6%
                            `the employee's for benefits`          IS 6%)
              ELSE NOTHING

-- §12 (chapter ה' (6)): (1) and (2) of chapter ה' do not apply to one in
-- managers' insurance with contributions in place of severance of 8 1/3%;
-- where those are above 6% and below 8 1/3%, (1) and (2) apply, but (א)
-- in (1) the product of that rate and 12 takes the place of 72%, and (ב)
-- in (2) what remains of 100% takes the place of 28%.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_12 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_12__subpara_6 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_12__subpara_6/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_12__subpara_6__cls_a akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_1__para_12__subpara_6__cls_b
GIVEN `the rate in place of severance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `what annex ג' puts in place of 72%` `the rate in place of severance` IS
    IF `the rate in place of severance` `is above` (6%) AND `the rate in place of severance` LESS THAN (25 DIVIDED BY 3 DIVIDED BY 100)
    THEN JUST (`the rate in place of severance` TIMES 12)
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN `the rate in place of severance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `what annex ג' puts in place of 28%` `the rate in place of severance` IS
    CONSIDER `what annex ג' puts in place of 72%` `the rate in place of severance`
    WHEN JUST s THEN JUST (100% MINUS s)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- §13: disputes on it are settled by chapter ט"ז of the agreement of
-- 3.3.99 (imported: `deciding disputes over the transition agreement`). §14: it exhausts the parties' claims on its matters, and no
-- further negotiation is held on them. §15: §19 of the framework agreement
-- (industrial peace, above) reaches it. §16 (¶23): the changes of §§9, 10
-- and 11 are carried out from the salary of February 2011, by March 2011's
-- at the latest, back to 1.1.2011, at the dates those sections set.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_2__para_13/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_2__para_14/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1__hc_2__para_15/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1/p23
`the pension-transition amendment's claims are exhausted` MEANS TRUE

`making the amended pension-transition contributions` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `make the pension contributions of the amended pension-transition agreement`

`the latest salary month the amended contributions start with` MEANS LIST 2011, 3

